      "content": "I'm a bit confused by your explanation. Could you stick to the technical terminology? I'm trying to write this for a formal sociology journal, so I need to understand the actual statistical mechanics of why the p-value and the confidence interval might provide slightly different perspectives on the strength/precision of my finding. Specifically, how does the width of that interval relate to the certainty of the effect?",
